{"type":"message","id":"afb2e2b0","parentId":"c698541f","timestamp":"2026-04-01T13:00:37.578Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Exploring GitHub API options**\n\nI’m considering using the GitHub API, possibly through a web fetch to access a JSON endpoint. It seems like I could search for issues within a specific repository using the search feature at api.github.com. I wonder if this will give me the data I need efficiently. Let’s see how the request processes and whether it meets my requirements! This could be a great way to streamline my work.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0a25d98ca97090020169cd16ee381c8191964f1911958a8b70\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpzRbxYkdEp4x8Xo-Yx80pHw0P9Tp8a_gP1VSatNsrnlj4jvDyEjk-ZGv-TAPm04mwxPL0zsnZ1Reyu1r8mkx-nVAyYofv0pEKLGrfBm-7H2_NL9GQGwCy_yv44r1foCoFo6rWDnMi7SfJGbfZXCX5It3zlgQdsuONaFlXJgvOh9wD6IXK97IAzTIXGXtbjxn3k9QyV14066ai8CarUZ3caAH8WRE20EjKZ8myVs230CD4VGw4ktThWhEu0v36q7GRsBBS1IGma6a87dPVRSJrOvEx0tCQ2EHKFclww10ljrR2AnaGOTcOXp6f2dz-wn514lrHzGcXV5I2eQxhZHS34Ujd-B3kPEFOuMzSBJa7c1jVvS07LQpaSu7ptpEg8iGlnMhdJqqi7t8lvj0CBl2SEQeaV4ObEUKeNneAoB4X_YekMdEWcj2cmkbebezs_-k8XBEqtNLfF3UMtZGkX6TK3EbQDLd9Z5IOEqk1To-1tVsHV7MnUDP0MvYpWXcELMXh0LcPx_3aLGP0fWB15CC_Ls_fPn_kwdmaWe4EdXCCMEH7kOVVMMdvyC7yw5MKWnyGAn9-FuuH-29-GZ8EcSzJhjwJG4Ib1RxuH4v-NyyYxMCVKtO9O2VjqeSmTUIvZH3_Kf3_Lu3pzukDz9J-KcjDm_sqj3bXtZ5-ebWQ9HhuRc-XiMqvD3Sf_I0JBqzB0JSHM3Hlb1Ayo_ScLlGs38NfQZLueyx6yCwSvDSPGiqnUi0ZrmnF79s_8s-eGfsnQ76Cj6NjVxfsi_Yl3JcVvRMnYf0iCGZNVjzVxsi5bjbKWRk-6a8Is_vTlL7g0Ep69R_gR_OBR0YBXavBiDX3bSO8vt3ERcRKlPQwcpmswAhEFplGXSiZGffFnZ4KAFS-q622Xb5af1Tch8sz7I6sqXfNPJ2gQ7V8nwpZp51BsWuqvvS8PRqe21n_nrAknXaBdpr17jSUQ_DlMVN154-S9PjcY3I9-w==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Exploring GitHub API options**\\n\\nI’m considering using the GitHub API, possibly through a web fetch to access a JSON endpoint. It seems like I could search for issues within a specific repository using the search feature at api.github.com. I wonder if this will give me the data I need efficiently. Let’s see how the request processes and whether it meets my requirements! This could be a great way to streamline my work.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub 页面抓不到列表，我改用公开 API 快扫近 2 小时更新项。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0a25d98ca97090020169cd16f125c08191bfead3b6700c5184\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_y6lfBazIfwRc1gdSdWKqU9j5|fc_0a25d98ca97090020169cd16f55d7c8191920fcc32c6c41cdd","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:open+updated:>=2026-04-01T11:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=20","extractMode":"text","maxChars":20000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:open+updated:>=2026-04-01T11:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=20\",\"extractMode\":\"text\",\"maxChars\":20000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_pGSyLmGtTBpdNp6WhbERWxAg|fc_0a25d98ca97090020169cd16f55d8c819190a1442540f9839c","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:pr+is:open+updated:>=2026-04-01T11:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=20","extractMode":"text","maxChars":20000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:pr+is:open+updated:>=2026-04-01T11:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=20\",\"extractMode\":\"text\",\"maxChars\":20000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Sny5iYbWkcjTSEfWYoq2BKOx|fc_0a25d98ca97090020169cd16f55d90819182aff9de960bb661","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+label:plugin+updated:>=2026-04-01T11:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=20","extractMode":"text","maxChars":12000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+label:plugin+updated:>=2026-04-01T11:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=des